---
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "VDW Eye-Tracking Analysis Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline for a Voice-Directed Warehousing (VDW) eye-tracking
  study. Processes Pupil Labs Neon exports; assigns each logged event a
  descriptive category (signage, drop, label, sticker, pallet movement,
  etc.); computes per-event windowed metrics (fixation duration, blink
  rate, gaze position and heatmap); performs non-parametric group
  comparisons by sex, origin, and warehouse location; and renders
  per-participant HTML dashboards.
